-- The positive formers that are not ℕ. 𝟘 leaves no hole at all;
-- quot-elim's well-definedness arrives as an ordinary obligation, no
-- new mechanism; squash-elim does not refine the goal AT ALL — by
-- el-squash-e-prf its body is checked at the same proposition, with a
-- witness added to the context — so it adds a hypothesis rather than
-- splitting a goal (docs/NovaElaboration.txt, In-place elimination).
s : (x : ℕ ⊎ ℕ) → ℕ
s = λx. ?g1

z : (x : 𝟘) → ℕ
z = λx. ?g2

q : (x : ℕ / (a b. a ≡ b ∈ ℕ)) → ℕ
q = λx. ?g3

w : (x : ∥ℕ∥) → ∥ℕ∥
w = λx. ?g4

-- squash-elim reaches only further PROPOSITIONS, so at this goal the
-- elimination does not elaborate — and the trial says so instead of
-- handing back a broken file (verified, not trusted)
bad : (x : ∥ℕ∥) → ℕ
bad = λx. ?g5
